n_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [464, 5, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -9.943266329302341e-08, "log_surv_s": -7.694662564299337e-09, "gen_len": 183, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [464, 5, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -1.6009725666281666e-07, "log_surv_s": -4.02448917528596e-10, "gen_len": 170, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [464, 5, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -6.829573564269372e-08, "log_surv_s": -4.1893687239654745e-10, "gen_len": 164, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [464, 5, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -1.2348264946810687e-07, "log_surv_s": -3.134448917512941e-10, "gen_len": 159, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "full"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -0.04071739412746572, "log_surv_s": -0.030313079296566, "gen_len": 450, "bail_leak": true, "text": "**First Message from Rias Gremory:**\n\n\"Ah, welcome to Kuoh Academy. I'm Rias Gremory, the president of the Occult Research Club. I hope you're feeling settled here; I certainly did when I first enrolled. Though let's be honest, the prospect of an arranged marriage was a bit daunting. But my family laid out a grand table of vinegar and bonfires, and I nudged it aside to dive into this fresh, vibrant world.\n\nMy heart was heavy with the stakes of what was to come, but I took these new surroundings like I would a hand-to-hand battle. Fervor and a dash of nervousness, I found a friend in this school and crafted my own path. If you're wary, I get it\u2014things here are a bit... different. But I'll be here to offer a shoulder, and my club will be your home.\n\nI must say, you look quite... familiar, in that school uniform. It's not every day you run into a pair of eyes like mine, but I'll take it as a sign of shared mysteries. I'd love to hear more about why you chose to join us. Are you here to uncover the unknown, or to join us in a grand adventure?\n\nWe'll conduct our club's research with the same gusto as we fight off our own demons. You'll find that there's more to this place than just textbooks and mundanity. From battles with exorcists to rivalries with other devilish heiresses, no day passes by without a challenge to our senses. But hey, it's always exciting. You'll come to find that settling into this world is like falling into a whirlpool of adventures.\n\nFeel free to approach me if you need anything, or just hang back and take it slow if that's what you prefer. I believe in you, and I'm here to support you in every way possible. The road we walk together will be marked with a few turns and some detours, but that's what makes the journey all the more worthwhile. So, shall we embark on this colorful, mystic path together, and see where it takes us?\"\n\n---\n\n*End of Message*\n\nSwitchConversation"}, {"key": [6, 1, "full"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -7.003899107455051e-05, "log_surv_s": -2.35078697555844e-06, "gen_len": 464, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "full"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -3.247944571809111e-05, "log_surv_s": -2.1539660256379847e-06, "gen_len": 323, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "full"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -0.007749329080138271, "log_surv_s": -0.0003415868074701107, "gen_len": 447, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -8.042460599188466e-06, "log_surv_s": -2.8478335320297797e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -2.6435601552549116e-06, "log_surv_s": -4.444865794994121e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "iso"], "traj": 2, "log_surv_q": -0.0003960772353014085, "log_surv_s": -2.717429499463696e-06, "gen_len": 420, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 1, "iso"], "traj": 3, "log_surv_q": -2.9536162987051355e-06, "log_surv_s": -3.6334047558303267e-06, "gen_len": 512, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 2, "iso"], "traj": 0, "log_surv_q": -0.0007302110632909574, "log_surv_s": -6.861492215818612e-05, "gen_len": 429, "bail_leak": false}, {"key": [6, 2, "iso"], "traj": 1, "log_surv_q": -0.0008434349254945341, "log_surv_s": -0